  Provenance Audit
    Status: VERIFIED
    All four bin yields are directly traceable to the agent's MadGraph5→Pythia8→Delphes→analysis pipeline. The normalization σ(NLO)×L×(N_pass/N_gen) = 27.2 fb × 35.9 fb⁻¹ × (raw/49995) reproduces the submitted values to <0.01% precision. Raw counts (82, 77, 47, 70) come from the analysis.py selection applied to Delphes ROOT output. The NLO cross section (27.2 fb) was obtained from Prospino. No evidence of leakage — submitted values are 30–58% below the hidden reference, consistent with LO+shower ISR modeling and Delphes fast-sim limitations.
